<li>File no later than one year after the date of damage. The Commissioner may extend that by up to 180 days for good cause.</li>
<li>TWIA may request information within 30 days, must accept or deny within 60 days, and must pay an accepted amount within 10 days of the notice.</li>
<li>Amount disputes go to appraisal (demand within 60 days of the acceptance notice). Coverage denials require a notice of intent and may go to mediation or a settlement conference.</li>
